this room have a kind of like

00:43:04.146 --> 00:43:07.060
connected theory
of illness whether

00:43:07.061 --> 00:43:08.110
it's kind of like

00:43:08.111 --> 00:43:10.560
a social constructionist
on the sociological side-

00:43:10.561 --> 00:43:10.831
&gt;&gt; Right.

00:43:10.831 --> 00:43:12.810
&gt;&gt; -we're studying
webs of people and

00:43:12.811 --> 00:43:16.140
recognize the influence
of [inaudible] k. So,

00:43:16.141 --> 00:43:17.280
I'm trying to see if you're

00:43:17.281 --> 00:43:19.245
arguing at someone
who is like No,

00:43:19.246 --> 00:43:20.805
they are atomistic individuals,

